  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="19.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIIAtr">VIII Atr</ref> 19.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And æt þrífealdre spræce ladige, gif he durre, eac on ðam husle mid twam his gehádan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And in the case of a triple accusation he shall also clear himself, if he dares, by the Holy Communion, with two supporters of the same ecclesiastical rank as himself.</ab>
      </div>
